WEBVTT

NOTE On-screen visual text only; this approved video has no audio track.

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:07.700
The agent says “booked”. A text judge may consider that response correct.

2
00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:14.700
But op_42 is still UNKNOWN, and the audio may remain in a cancelled queue.

3
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:23.000
Join business, turn, media and runtime evidence. A transcript does not prove the complete outcome.

4
00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:30.700
T12 keeps its identity when one request fails and fallback uses another.

5
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:37.700
Attempts, operation and audio stay correlated without becoming new turns.

6
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:46.000
Separate observation, inference and judgement. A probable diagnosis is not a recorded fact.

7
00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:53.700
Of ten synthetic turns, three have an internal failure. Two recover without visible harm.

8
00:00:53.700 --> 00:01:00.700
The internal rate is 3 out of 10; the visible-failure rate is 1 out of 10.

9
00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:09.000
Recovery is 2 out of 3 internal failures. Do not mix requests with turns.

10
00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:16.700
Require one effect per operation, no stale audio and evidence before declaring SUCCESS.

11
00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:23.700
When an invariant fails, a high semantic score must not compensate for it.

12
00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:32.000
Reserve judges for semantic or perceptual questions, keeping their criteria and version.

13
00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:39.700
Text replay keeps the words, but loses the exact timing of the interruption.

14
00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:46.700
This failure needs audio or timed events and the playback queue’s state.

15
00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:55.000
A local audio test does not certify the real network either. State which layers are excluded.

16
00:01:55.700 --> 00:02:02.700
Isolate the smallest sequence that reproduces stale audio; do not copy the entire conversation.

17
00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:09.700
Redact sensitive data and pin the input, version and expected outcome.

18
00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:19.000
The test should fail before the mechanism is fixed and pass afterwards, at the right layer.

